Kali linux, Ubuntu, CentOS are the linux distribution / Distros (based on top of linux)
Linux is a kernel not OS

Virtualisation:
Running multiple virtual systems on one physical computer.

Hypervisor:
It is a software that creates and runs virtual machines (VMs).
Eg: Oracle VirtualBox

Types of Hypervisors:

Type 1 (Bare Metal) 
Hardware => Hypervisior => VM1,VM2

Type 2 (Hosted)
Host OS => Hypervisior => VM1,VM2

For accessing remote server we use Putty, Git Bash, Mobaxterm
